{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01804",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 8.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.98,
      "end_seconds": 14.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.74,
      "end_seconds": 18.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "It's a productive cough with rusty phlegm, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.86,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.02,
      "end_seconds": 29.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Um, it's been going on for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.92,
      "end_seconds": 42.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Um, it happens all the time. It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.55,
      "end_seconds": 49.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Alright, did you get coughing up blood, confusion or recent travel?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.99,
      "end_seconds": 55.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "No, no coughing up blood, confusion or recent travel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.82,
      "end_seconds": 60.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Okay, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.07,
      "end_seconds": 64.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.11,
      "end_seconds": 85.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.78,
      "end_seconds": 94.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Grass pollen. I come out in... well, itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.12,
      "end_seconds": 107.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.71,
      "end_seconds": 115.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I've, I've had COPD, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.22,
      "end_seconds": 128.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Right, so COPD is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.75,
      "end_seconds": 141.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "I'm on Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I take paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.04,
      "end_seconds": 144.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.28,
      "end_seconds": 146.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.82,
      "end_seconds": 150.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.06,
      "end_seconds": 164.33,
      "duration_seconds": 12.27,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. Nothing, I'm teetotal. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 178.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.43,
      "end_seconds": 194.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.28,
      "end_seconds": 222.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 97 percent, heart rate 95. And blood pressure 124 over 73, respiratory rate 18, temperature is 38.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.97,
      "end_seconds": 227.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.17,
      "end_seconds": 245.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.25,
      "end_seconds": 248.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.65,
      "end_seconds": 267.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "There are crackles at the right base and the breathing is a bit fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.34,
      "end_seconds": 292.99,
      "duration_seconds": 21.65,
      "text": "You can relax now. From what you've told me and what I found, I'd lean towards community-acquired pneumonia. Let's get a chest X-ray, for possible pneumonia. You'll be taking amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day, five days. That should help with chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.42,
      "end_seconds": 298.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.98,
      "end_seconds": 315.89,
      "duration_seconds": 16.91,
      "text": "Rest, drink plenty, and come back if you are not improving in two days. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.55,
      "end_seconds": 319.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Erm, that's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.91,
      "end_seconds": 329.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "I'd like you back in one week. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.33,
      "end_seconds": 334.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.22,
      "end_seconds": 336.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}